    <title>#020：❤️番外篇：2025 Dating App 的打开方式和操作技巧？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677b7a001e823e72d38e439e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677b7a001e823e72d38e439e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jan 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，今次是一个Dating App 番外篇。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrAa2vP4tDH7csl8I_ZhB-bdFtOw.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>由于上期Dating App 的EP有很多朋友说剖析得不够彻底，今天我们一起析解一下dating app 的整个操作：由建立转化率高的profile — 快速判断对方的是否合适— 到约线下见面聊什么—到seduction — &nbsp;变成长期关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今次二位嘉宾透过Dating App 成功脱单的：</span></p><span></span><p><span>宝子，健身教练＋博主，Dating App 经验：5年＋。</span></p><span></span><p><span>黑仔，广告公司创业人，Dating App 经验：8年＋。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lyris，主持＋创意人，Dating App 经验：0 年 。</span></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> : 如何建立Profile</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a> : 照片的场境，统一性，和滤镜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1544">25:44</a> : Profile的文字要写什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2119">35:19</a> : 怎样约TA出来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> : 出来约在哪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> : 见面怎破冰？约会礼仪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3428">57:08</a>: Dating 技巧 — 收集3个IOI</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3612">1:00:12</a>: Dating 技巧 — Negging</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4323">1:12:03</a>: Dating 加分项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4879">1:21:19</a>: Dating 的”惊喜”经验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5203">1:26:43</a>: 下一步的暗示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5730">1:35:30</a>: Dating App 和个人成长</span></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>宝子：📕: 宝Beverly | V: Emoz0805 |</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nash ：📕黑色黑仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>.</span></p><span></span><p><span>有关《格格不入》Hi 我是正在创业的广告人黑仔。每次，我都会找来一位“不为工资而活”的破格的朋友，和我们聊下他们怎样摆脱公司束缚，顺便了解一下他们的行业里的故事。</span></p>]]></description>
