    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jul 2024 09:29:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqkPa9sjCD0T_oel9O14-LIvZBy5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🎙️ 欢迎收听《格格不入》Podcast！每一集，我们都会邀请一个outlier，分享他们出格经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，我們請到旅行雜誌《LOST》的主脑Nelson來作客。Nelson曾在4As 廣告公司担任创意领导，其雜誌《LOST》拿过全球獨立雜誌年度獎項Stack Awards的最佳美術設計獎，在上海，台北，NYC，柏林的書店都有上架。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhwRqXb_EC8_lTtqBP8mwUO4l7FO.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljfbRcG0ZFdUfQvUCd3GeLizikZi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>今期，我拉着他聊一下，如果我们想做📰要怎样开始？做旅行📰的他，對旅行有何看法？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a>: 一个人做📰要用多久？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a>: 时间投入？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a>: 创作流程？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a>: 有了idea , 怎样找到帮手？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a>: 开始，不需要business plan</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a>: 怎样做渠道， 怎样抽成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">19:11</a>: 《LOST》的一个小故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a>: 杂志人眼中的好杂志《Apartamento》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1859">30:59</a>: 杂志人眼中旅行的意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2047">34:07</a>: 快VS慢的旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2409">40:09</a>: Q&amp;A</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨以下是在對話提到的雜誌和行程</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Apartamento》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjhmLVV2hDtyfZD_0NctzjzeDG4k.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>《the gentlewoman》</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj8wDEYeIC02Dz-f9LVaX2LWna0k.png"></figure><span></span><h1><strong><span>K3火车6天行程，北京到莫斯科</span></strong></h1><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9uaW1nLndzLjEyNi5uZXQvP3VybD1odHRwJTNBJTJGJTJGc3BpZGVyLndzLjEyNi5uZXQlMkZjNGIzMjRkYmM5ZDI4MTBhYTg2MzhiYjNhYjUzMTU3My5qcGVnJnRodW1ibmFpbD02NjB4MjE0NzQ4MzY0NyZxdWFsaXR5PTgwJnR5cGU9anBn"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly80LmJwLmJsb2dzcG90LmNvbS8tN1FHNmlmeFBIR3MvWFAwbEJCX0FnTEkvQUFBQUFBQUFBZnMvRXNFVGZnMjBMSFEyRkZGT0hmSlo5eTBUTDFBTE4wNFZnQ0s0QkdBWVlDdy9zNDAwL0lNR18yNDM0LkpQRw==.JPG"></p><span></span><p><span>K3 火車途径中国、蒙古国、俄罗斯三国，穿越36座城市，全程7692公里，经历六天五夜，是中国铁路史上里程最长的旅客列车。</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多🙈内容，请订阅《格格不入》Cheers🥂</span></p><span></span><p><img alt="FirfQdhVXmJX5UkY3T62LaEv9bML.png" src="blob:https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/b0a68c2b-5615-44fc-80da-2fcbc9178165"></p>]]></description>
